BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>Transfer planning: Moon and Mars from Earth orbit</h1>
A delta-glider in a 300 km Earth orbit in March 2001. The script searches
transfers to the Moon and to Mars (the 2001 window: Mars Odyssey left on
7 April 2001) and makes their manoeuvre nodes, refined with the numerical
trajectory prediction to the targeted periapsis.
END_HYPERDESC

BEGIN_ENVIRONMENT
  System Sol
  Date MJD 51982.6685767396
  Script Tests/TransferPlanTest
END_ENVIRONMENT

BEGIN_FOCUS
  Ship GL-P
END_FOCUS

BEGIN_CAMERA
  TARGET GL-P
  MODE Extern
  POS 4 0 -20
  TRACKMODE TargetRelative
  FOV 50.00
END_CAMERA

BEGIN_SHIPS
GL-P:DeltaGlider
  STATUS Orbiting Earth
  ELEMENTS 6671000.0 0.00000 28.5 0.0 0.0 0.0 51982.6685767396
  AROT 0 0 0
  PRPLEVEL 0:1.000 1:1.000
END
END_SHIPS
